    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d51">

                <pb facs="0326" n="40" xml:id="pg40"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72111/3880</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Roumania</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Vopicka</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bucharest</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-07-22">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">July 22, 1916, noon</hi>
                        </date>.<lb/>[<hi rendition="#italic">Received July 24, 10 p.
                        m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>279. Roumania has received from Russia 60 cars of ammunition and prominent
                    Roumanian general informs me will receive within 10 days 100 cars more. This
                    seems positively to indicate an agreement between Russia and Roumania. Will keep
                    Department informed as to further developments.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Vopicka</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
